# Keep `tauri dev`'s file watcher off the Python sidecar venv + caches — they
# hold thousands of files (faster-whisper, rapidocr/onnxruntime) and get written
# to when the sidecars run (transcribe / detect_boundaries / detect_buttons),
# which would otherwise trigger a full Rust rebuild mid-session.
sidecar/.venv/
sidecar/**/__pycache__/
gen/
